# Nested git worktrees created inside the repo root (EnterWorktree / `.worktrees`).
# They are full repo copies with their own BUILD.bazel files and node_modules
# symlink trees; `bazel //...` would otherwise descend into them and abort on
# cross-worktree target-visibility errors and infinite node_modules symlink loops.
.claude/worktrees
.worktrees

# pnpm workspace node_modules trees. pnpm creates a self-referential
# `node_modules/node_modules` symlink, which `bazel query //...` reports as
# "infinite symlink expansion detected" — a hard BUILD file error that aborts the
# query with a non-zero exit and an empty result set (`bazel test` merely logs and
# skips it). Without these entries `make build-drift-check` is green in CI (which
# never runs `pnpm install`) and permanently red on every dev/agent worktree.
# Safe to ignore: no BUILD.bazel or .bzl lives under them, and web/marketing/docs
# tests run through turbo (`make test-web`), never bazel.
#
# Keep this list in sync with the members of `pnpm-workspace.yaml` (plus
# `services/docs`): a workspace member that gains its first dependency starts
# materialising its own node_modules tree, and the resulting query failure is
# silent (both `bazel query` calls in check-build-drift.sh redirect stderr), so
# the gate goes red with no diagnostic. `lib/ui-tokens` has no dependencies today
# and so no tree on disk; the entry is listed pre-emptively and is a harmless
# no-op until it does.
node_modules
lib/ui-tokens/node_modules
services/web/node_modules
services/marketing/node_modules
services/docs/node_modules

# Worktree-local `.config` tree. `make setup-worktree` copies the gitignored
# `/.config/` dir (see .gitignore) into EVERY worktree, including agent and cron
# ones, and it holds materialized agent homes under `.config/accounts/`. A
# projected codex home ships the `Codex Computer Use.app` bundle, whose
# `Contents/Resources/BUILD.bazel` loads `@build_bazel_rules_swift` — a repo we
# do not depend on. `bazel //...` therefore aborts while LOADING packages
# ("could not be resolved: No repository visible as '@build_bazel_rules_swift'"),
# which red-lights `make test` and `make build-drift-check` on every worktree
# with a codex account projected while CI (no `.config`) stays green. Safe to
# ignore: the tree is gitignored local state and owns no repo build targets.
.config
